      "message": "One notification per user in the group is sent here, saying that a role assignment for that user has been deleted.\n\nThis is not true, since the deleted role assignment was a group one.\n\nSuppose the following scenario:\n\ni) User U in Group G, Role R and Project P;\nii) There are two assignments:\n    - U, R, P\n    - G, R, P\n\nIf you delete the second one (G, R, P), a notification telling (U, R, P) was deleted will be sent, which would tell a lie to any listener, since the role assignment (U, R, P) still exists.\n\nAnother issue here is that you send two notifications per user: one from the annotation in this method and another at this statement.",
